cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PathAsk: a conversational whole-slide-image pathology agent with a traceable evidence chain"
abstract: >-
  PathAsk is a research-grade conversational agent for whole-slide-image (WSI)
  pathology. Given a slide and a question, it scans at low magnification, selects
  and zooms into regions, has a pathology vision-language model describe what it
  sees, pulls clinical and knowledge context, and returns a structured report in
  which every conclusion points back to region coordinates, magnification and
  morphological description. It is a reference implementation, not a medical
  device, and distributes no model weights or data.
type: software
